<title>USA: AlliedSignal completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>AlliedSignal completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>TORRANCE, Calif. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>AlliedSignal Inc unit AlliedSignal Aerospace Monday completed its acquisition of Grimes Aerospace from an affiliate of New York investment firm Forstmann Little &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were undisclosed.</p>
<p>Grimes Aerospace, with annual sales roughly $230 million, makes lighting systems, aircraft engine systems and other products for the aerospace and defense industries.</p>
<p>Grimes was founded in 1933 and employs about 1,400 people around the world.</p>
